        Bringing together entrepreneurs, investors, government, academia,
        NGOs and communities to build enterprises that create meaningful
        social impact.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeva_29NgrAR1EK8uhSLtEo1jbNzhO45JS-qDl_MH8xTXg_FA/viewform" target="_blank" class="event-primary-btn">
