            </g>

            <g>
              <circle cx="42" cy="95" r="23" class="eco-node eco-node-blue" />
              <text x="42" y="133" text-anchor="middle" class="eco-label">Women-led</text>
            </g>
          </svg>

          
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>

      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="section-kicker">About</span>
         <h2 class="event-section-title pb-6">
          Where purpose meets
          <span class="text-grad-blue-purple">enterprise.</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-[#667085]">
          The Social Entrepreneurship Conclave 2026 is a platform designed to
          bring together social entrepreneurs, startups, investors, NGOs,
          government, academia, communities, and ecosystem partners to
          foster collaboration, knowledge exchange, mentorship, market
          access and partnerships. The conclave aims to strengthen the
          social entrepreneurship ecosystem in Kerala and to create social
          startups based on technology or product innovation. The conclave
          also envisions empowering social and women enterprises to scale
          their impact and build home-grown global brands from Kerala.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-[#667085]">
            The conclave will facilitate knowledge exchange, partnerships,
            mentor connect, product showcase and market linkages, enabling
            social enterprises to scale their impact and build home-grown
            global brands from Kerala.
          </p>

          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-[#667085]">
            The event will also witness the launch of the first women
            startup cell in Kerala and the release of the Women Startup
            Handbook, alongside the Social Entrepreneurship Programme and
            the Startup Literacy Campaign.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="event-quote reveal mt-20 hidden">
      <span>“</span>

      <p>
        Strengthening Kerala's social entrepreneurship ecosystem by creating
        technology and product-driven social startups that can scale impact
        locally and globally.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
