        </div>

        <div class="initiative-symbol">+</div>
        <span class="initiative-category">Women Entrepreneurship</span>

        <h3>Women Startup Cell</h3>

        <p>
          Kerala's first Women Startup Cell — a single point of access
          connecting women entrepreneurs with KSUM schemes, mentorship,
          incubation, co-working spaces, labs and ecosystem support.
        </p>

        <button class="initiative-link" data-initiative-modal="women">
